{"ref":"BDB, שִׁבְיָה","hw":"שִׁבְיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁבְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. captivity, captives</strong> (coll.), cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שְׁבִי²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שְׁבִי²\">שְׁבִי</a>;—always abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  state of <em>captivity</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:46\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.46\">Je 48:46</a> (of <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנוֹת</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִי</span> of <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִים</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.36\">Ne 3:36</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  body of <em>captives</em>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.11\">Dt 21:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:42\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.42\">32:42</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָלָל</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.13\">2 Ch 28:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.15\">15</a>; object of <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁבָה</span>, v <sup>5</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">(שׁ׳ גדולה)</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָשִׁיבוּ הַשּׁ׳ אֲשֶׁר שְׁבִיתֶם</span> v <sup>11</sup>.","next":"BDB, שְׁבִית","prev":"BDB, שָׁבִי"}